# Course and lab authoring rules

When generating, outlining, editing, or validating **slide courses** in this repository, read and strictly follow:

- [.agents/skills/course-generator/SKILL.md](.agents/skills/course-generator/SKILL.md)
- [.agents/skills/course-generator/examples/layout-templates.md](.agents/skills/course-generator/examples/layout-templates.md)

Put slide chapters and shared images under `course/`. Put labs under `labs/`.

When a **Lab Generator** skill is added under `.agents/skills/lab-generator/`, follow that skill for all lab Markdown.
